#: wikitolearn-guide-chapter-2.mw:1
msgid ""
"A course is a collection of pages with a well defined tree structure.\n"
"Every course on WikiToLearn has a unique name.\n"
"You can create a private course under your namespace or a public and "
"collaborative course."
msgstr ""
"Un cursu ye una coleición de páxines con una cadarma n'árbole bien "
"definida.\n"
"Cada cursu en WikiToLearn tien un nome únicu.\n"
"Pues crear un cursu priváu sol to espaciu de nome o un cursu públicu y "
"collaborativu."

#: wikitolearn-guide-chapter-2.mw:1
msgid "Create a course"
msgstr "Creación d'un cursu"

#: wikitolearn-guide-chapter-2.mw:6
msgid ""
"The first thing to do to create a course is going to the right department "
"and the right topic.\n"
"For example, if you are writing a <code>Quantum Physics</code> course, you "
"need to go to the Physics department."
msgstr ""
"La primer cosa que facer pa crear un cursu ye dir al departamentu y tema "
"correutos.\n"
"Por exemplu, si tas escribiendo un cursu de <code>física cuántica</code> "
"precises dir al departamentu Física."

#: wikitolearn-guide-chapter-2.mw:9
msgid ""
"Find the most appropriate topic and click on it.\n"
"In the previous example, you should look for a topic named \"Quantum Physics"
"\" or \"Quantum Mechanics\"."
msgstr ""
"Atopa'l tema más afayadizu y calca nelli.\n"
"Nel exemplu anterior, debiesti buscar un tema col nome «Física cuántica» o "
"«Mecánica cuántica»"

#: wikitolearn-guide-chapter-2.mw:12
msgid "Click the \"Create Course\" button: a form will show up."
msgstr "Primi nel botón «Crear un cursu». Va amosase un formulariu."

#: wikitolearn-guide-chapter-2.mw:14
msgid ""
"'''Note:''' if there isn't an appropriate topic for the course, you can "
"create one by clicking the \"Create Course and Topic\" button on the "
"department page.\n"
"The name of the topic will be the same as the name of the course."
msgstr ""
"'''Nota:''' si nun hai un tema afayadizu pal cursu, pues crear unu faciendo "
"clic nel botón «Crear un cursu y tema» na páxina del departamentu.\n"
"El nome del tema va ser el mesmu que'l del cursu."

#: wikitolearn-guide-chapter-2.mw:17
msgid "[[<ref:FILE_28>]]"
msgstr "[[<ref:FILE_28>]]"

#: wikitolearn-guide-chapter-2.mw:19
msgid ""
"You can choose to make the course public or private.\n"
"A public course is located under the related department, while a private "
"course is located under the user namespace."
msgstr ""
"Pues escoyer el facer el cursu públicu o priváu.\n"
"Un cursu públicu allúgase sol departamentu venceyáu mentanto qu'un cursu "
"públicu allúgase nel espaciu de nome del usuariu."

#: wikitolearn-guide-chapter-2.mw:22
msgid ""
"It is strongly recommended to create a private course and publish it once "
"completed.\n"
"However, if you decide to create a public course, it will be displayed under "
"the <code>Department/Topic</code> url and everyone can modify it by "
"creating, moving and deleting content."
msgstr ""
"Aconséyase muncho crear un cursu priváu y espublizalu cuando se complete.\n"
"Por embargu, si decides crear un cursu públicu, va amosase so la url de "
"<code>departamentu/tema</code> y tol mundu va poder modificalu creando, "
"moviendo y desaniciando conteníu."

#: wikitolearn-guide-chapter-2.mw:22
msgid "Course Metadata"
msgstr "Metadatos del cursu"

#: wikitolearn-guide-chapter-2.mw:27
msgid ""
"It is possible to add additional information to a course.\n"
"This is helpful when you have some external links or PDF with exercises, "
"notes or bibliography that you want to attach to the course."
msgstr ""
"Ye posible amestar información adicional a un cursu.\n"
"Esto ye útil cuando tienes dalgunos enllaces esternos o PDFs con exercicios, "
"apuntes o bibliografía que quieras axuntar al cursu."

#: wikitolearn-guide-chapter-2.mw:30
msgid "[[<ref:FILE_29>]]"
msgstr "[[<ref:FILE_29>]]"

#: wikitolearn-guide-chapter-2.mw:32
msgid ""
"To add metadata visit the course main page and click on the \"Edit metadata"
"\" button.\n"
"Then you can add the additional information in the respective input fields.\n"
"In particular, you can add information about:"
msgstr ""
"P'amestar metadatos, visita la páxina principal del cursu y calca nel botón "
"«Editar metadatos».\n"
"Darréu va poder amestar la información adicional nos campos d'entrada "
"correspondientes.\n"
"En particular, pues amestar información tocante a:"

#: wikitolearn-guide-chapter-2.mw:32
msgid "Bibliography"
msgstr "Bibliografía"

#: wikitolearn-guide-chapter-2.mw:32
msgid "Exercises"
msgstr "Exercicios"

#: wikitolearn-guide-chapter-2.mw:32
msgid "Books"
msgstr "Llibros"

#: wikitolearn-guide-chapter-2.mw:32
msgid "External References"
msgstr "Referencies esternes"

#: wikitolearn-guide-chapter-2.mw:32
msgid "Publish a course"
msgstr "Espublización d'un cursu"

#: wikitolearn-guide-chapter-2.mw:42
msgid ""
"If you created a private course, it will stay under your user namespace "
"unless you decide to publish it.\n"
"To publish a private course, navigate to the course main page and click on "
"the \"Publish Course\" button.\n"
"A WikiToLearn's admin will take into account the request and will move the "
"content to the public topic page."
msgstr ""
"Si creesti un cursu priváu, va quedar sol to espaciu de nome a nun ser que "
"decidas espublizalu.\n"
"Pa espublizar un cursu priváu, navega hasta la páxina principal del cursu y "
"calca nel botón «Espublizar el cursu».\n"
"Un alministrador de WikiToLearn va considerar la solicitú y va mover el "
"conteníu a la páxina del tema públicu."

#: wikitolearn-guide-chapter-2.mw:46
msgid "[[<ref:FILE_30>]]"
msgstr "[[<ref:FILE_30>]]"

